  "body": "#115 G4 限定交付收口。实现 [874e35fc](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/commit/874e35fc0af3b6cdf6f6461725eb1343152efbea)、[main与归档](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/commit/42b6fc3451eb31042bef80f995c4023eeb6c736b)；[独立G3](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/42b6fc3451eb31042bef80f995c4023eeb6c736b/tools/rust-r4ghi/independent/userfix-final/g3-review01.json)、[固定提交复核](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/42b6fc3451eb31042bef80f995c4023eeb6c736b/tools/rust-r4ghi/independent/userfix-final/fixed-review01.json)、[原件映射](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/42b6fc3451eb31042bef80f995c4023eeb6c736b/docs/design/archive/slices/rust-r2-user-create-fix115/origin-map01.json)。\n\n真实UUID和初始角色/主组织关联、必要审计/managed会话整体事务及锁内有效引用已实际验证；Rust416/54历史ignored，19场景、11故障重试、4引用锁竞态，UI N/A。121精确新增PK清理、原件恢复及API/PG停止/volume保留均独立核通过。仅关闭#115，#57/#101/#110/#116/#117保持Open；新增操作0，正式Rust240。实际线上读回和最终Seal作为后续终态原件，不提前伪造其结果。\n"
